{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.27","index":27,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.27.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"圣","pinyin":"shèng","traditional":"聖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"！"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maha besar Jalan Suci Nabi."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.27.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"yáng","traditional":"洋","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yáng","traditional":"洋","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"发","pinyin":"fā","traditional":"發","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"育","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"万","pinyin":"wàn","traditional":"萬","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"jùn","traditional":"峻","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"极","pinyin":"jí","traditional":"極","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Sangat luaslah Dia, berlaksa wujud dikembangkan dan dipelihara; kemuliaanNya meninggi langit."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.27.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"优","pinyin":"yōu","traditional":"優","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"优","pinyin":"yōu","traditional":"優","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"礼","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"禮","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"仪","pinyin":"yí","traditional":"儀","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sān","traditional":"三","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bǎi","traditional":"百","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wēi","traditional":"威","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"仪","pinyin":"yí","traditional":"儀","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sān","traditional":"三","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qiān","traditional":"千","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Alangkah besar peranan yang dijalankanNya; daripadanya ditetapkan tiga ratus macam tata susila dan tiga ribu macam peraturan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.27.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"dài","traditional":"待","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Hal ini menantikan orang kemudian yang dapat melaksanakannya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.27.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"gǒu","traditional":"苟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"níng","traditional":"凝","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka dikatakan, 'Kalau bukan yang telah mencapai Puncak Kebajikan, tidak akan dapat Dia mencapai puncak Jalan Suci.'"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.27.06","number":6,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zūn","traditional":"尊","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìng","traditional":"性","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"问","pinyin":"wèn","traditional":"問","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"学","pinyin":"xué","traditional":"學","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"致","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"广","pinyin":"guǎng","traditional":"廣","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"尽","pinyin":"jǐn","traditional":"盡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jīng","traditional":"精","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wēi","traditional":"微","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"极","pinyin":"jí","traditional":"極","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gāo","traditional":"高","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"中","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yōng","traditional":"庸","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"温","pinyin":"wēn","traditional":"溫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"新","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"dūn","traditional":"敦","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"厚","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chóng","traditional":"崇","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"礼","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"禮","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu memuliakan Kebajikan Watak Sejatinya dan menjalankan sifat suka belajar dan bertanya. Luas dan besarlah pengetahuannya sehingga dapat memahami apa yang lembut dan rahasia; dengan ketinggian dan kegemilangannya ia menjalankan Laku Tengah Sempurna; dengan mempelajari yang kuno ia dapat memahami yang Baru; dengan ketulusan hati yang tebal ia menjunjung Kesusilaan (S.S. II: 11)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.27.07","number":7,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"上","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"骄","pinyin":"jiāo","traditional":"驕","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bèi","traditional":"倍","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yán","traditional":"言","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zú","traditional":"足","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"兴","pinyin":"xìng","traditional":"興","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"默","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zú","traditional":"足","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"róng","traditional":"容","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"jì","traditional":"既","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qiě","traditional":"且","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhé","traditional":"哲","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bǎo","traditional":"保","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yǔ","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka pada saat berkedudukan tinggi ia tidak sombong dan pada saat berkedudukan rendah ia tidak berbimbang hati; pada saat negara di dalam Jalan Suci, kata-katanya cukup dapat membawa bahagia dan pada saat negara ingkar dari' Jalan Suci, kebungkamannya cukup untuk melindungi dirinya. Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, \"Kesadaran bathin yang sempurna itu akan dapat melindungi diri.\" Sanjak ini kiranya memaksudkan hal di atas. (III. 3.6.4) TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XXVII (Menetapi Kedudukan)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/27 - Bab XXVI - Jalan Suci Nabi.md","title":"Bab XXVI — Jalan Suci Nabi"}
